# `tsc -b` used to emit the compiled twin of vite.config.ts next to the source, where Vite
# loads it in preference to the .ts — so edits to the .ts silently did nothing. noEmit is set
# in tsconfig.node.json; these patterns stop a stray emission from being committed again.
